{"seq":3,"slug":"probability-commerce-metric","title":"概率商品运营与复购指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/mystery-box-probability-commerce/secondary-market-guard/probability-commerce-metric","wordCount":2033,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"概率商品运营与复购指标\">概率商品运营与复购指标</h1><p>概率商品的运营指标与普通电商有一处根本差异：<strong>收入不来自商品，来自不确定性的定价</strong>。同样的商品换成确定性销售，收入会落到一个价格点上；换成概率销售，收入取决于消费者愿意为不确定性支付多少溢价。这个溢价随参与强度上升而上升，随认知清醒而下降。因此运营指标体系必须同时测量三件事：卖了多少钱、用户为什么不走、以及这种留存是健康的还是被机制锁住的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三类指标的三角\">核心概念：三类指标的三角</h2><p>概率商品的指标必须三类同时看，任何一类单独看都会被另一类掩盖。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[概率商品指标] --&gt; B[收入类]&#10;  A --&gt; C[参与类]&#10;  A --&gt; D[健康类]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[ARPU / 单系列收入]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[期望毛利]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[复购率 / 抽次分布]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[保底触发率]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[消费集中度]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[投诉与退款率]&#10;  D --&gt; D3[未成年人占比]&#10;  B2 --&gt; E[健康度校准]&#10;  C2 --&gt; E&#10;  D1 --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[运营动作]\">graph TD\n  A[概率商品指标] --&gt; B[收入类]\n  A --&gt; C[参与类]\n  A --&gt; D[健康类]\n  B --&gt; B1[ARPU / 单系列收入]\n  B --&gt; B2[期望毛利]\n  C --&gt; C1[复购率 / 抽次分布]\n  C --&gt; C2[保底触发率]\n  D --&gt; D1[消费集中度]\n  D --&gt; D2[投诉与退款率]\n  D --&gt; D3[未成年人占比]\n  B2 --&gt; E[健康度校准]\n  C2 --&gt; E\n  D1 --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[运营动作]</pre><p>三角的关系是：收入类指标告诉你&quot;发生了什么&quot;，参与类指标告诉你&quot;为什么发生&quot;，健康类指标告诉你&quot;这个原因能不能持续&quot;。只看收入与参与会导致一个典型失败——用保底机制拉升复购，短期收入与复购双涨，中期消费集中度恶化、投诉上升，最终监管或舆情介入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"收入与成本指标\">收入与成本指标</h2><p>概率商品的收入指标必须与期望成本成对出现，否则无法判断增长质量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"期望毛利的计算口径\">期望毛利的计算口径</h3><p>单系列的期望毛利等于期望收入减期望成本。期望成本由概率表按权重加权求得，与 <a href=\"../probability-model-config/rarity-tier-probability-rule\">稀有度分层与概率规则</a> 中的成本模型同源。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>期望毛利</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{期望毛利} = r - \\sum_i p_i c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">期望毛利</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 为单次抽取净收入，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分别为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 层概率与单件成本。这个指标的关键性质是它是<strong>事前可算</strong>的——不需要等销售结束就能知道每个系列的毛利水平，因此可以在发售前就否决不可行的配置。</p>\n<h3 id=\"保底成本的影响\">保底成本的影响</h3><p>保底机制会系统性抬高期望成本，因为它把长尾抽取的次数压缩，使每一次抽取产出的层位分布发生变化。评估方法是对含保底的完整抽取模型做模拟，得到实际出货分布后再算成本，而不是直接用基础概率算。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 按系列汇总实际出货分布，与配置概率对照&#10;WITH actual AS (&#10;  SELECT series_id, config_version, result_tier,&#10;         COUNT(*)::numeric / SUM(COUNT(*)) OVER (PARTITION BY series_id, config_version) AS actual_pct,&#10;         COUNT(*) AS pulls&#10;  FROM pull_audit&#10;  WHERE issued_at &gt;= now() - interval &#39;30 days&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY series_id, config_version, result_tier&#10;), cfg AS (&#10;  SELECT series_id, version, tier,&#10;         weight::numeric / SUM(weight) OVER (PARTITION BY series_id, version) AS cfg_pct&#10;  FROM series_probability&#10;)&#10;SELECT a.series_id, a.result_tier, ROUND(a.actual_pct, 4) AS actual,&#10;       ROUND(c.cfg_pct, 4) AS configured,&#10;       ROUND(a.actual_pct - c.cfg_pct, 4) AS drift, a.pulls&#10;FROM actual a&#10;JOIN cfg c ON c.series_id = a.series_id AND c.version = a.config_version&#10;               AND c.tier = a.result_tier&#10;ORDER BY abs(a.actual_pct - c.cfg_pct) DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 按系列汇总实际出货分布，与配置概率对照</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actual </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> series_id, config_version, result_tier,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> series_id, config_version) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actual_pct,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pulls</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pull_audit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> issued_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> series_id, config_version, result_tier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), cfg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> series_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, tier,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         weight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">weight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> series_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cfg_pct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> series_probability</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">series_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">result_tier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">actual_pct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actual,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cfg_pct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> configured,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">actual_pct</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cfg_pct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> drift, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pulls</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actual a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cfg c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">series_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">series_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">config_version</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">               AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">result_tier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">actual_pct</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cfg_pct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>drift</code> 列是收入指标的护栏。若实际出货分布显著偏向高价值层，说明实际成本高于配置成本，毛利被侵蚀；若偏向前者相反方向，说明消费者体验下降。两种偏离都要在月度复盘里处理，而不是等年度结算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"参与指标-复购的正确读法\">参与指标：复购的正确读法</h2><p>复购率高在普通电商是好事，在概率商品里含义是分裂的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"抽次分布比复购率更有信息\">抽次分布比复购率更有信息</h3><p>复购率只是一个比例，抽次分布才显示结构。一个健康的分布应当有厚实的一次性用户群体与一条平滑衰减的长尾；不健康的分布呈现双峰——大量只抽一次的用户，和一批抽次极高的重度用户，中间断层。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分布形态</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>关注点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平滑衰减</td>\n<td>正常参与</td>\n<td>长尾尾部是否过厚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双峰（1 次 + 高次）</td>\n<td>机制吸附</td>\n<td>高次群体的消费占比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尖峰（集中在保底次数）</td>\n<td>保底驱动</td>\n<td>保底是否为唯一复购动因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长尾过厚</td>\n<td>沉迷风险</td>\n<td>是否需介入</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三个形态最值得警惕：当抽取次数集中在保底阈值附近时，说明复购的主要动因不是对商品的喜爱，而是&quot;已经投入这么多，不抽到底就亏了&quot;。研究对保底机制的这一面有明确观察——保底可能制造&quot;被困住&quot;的感受，使已经投入大量时间的玩家难以停止（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gacha_game\">Wikipedia: Gacha game</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"保底触发率的运营含义\">保底触发率的运营含义</h3><p>保底触发率是实际触发保底的抽取占比。它有两个方向的读法：过高说明基础概率偏低、用户体验差；过低说明保底形同虚设、消费者没有可算的成本上限。合理的区间需要按系列定位确定，但趋势比绝对值重要——保底触发率持续上升是基础概率被隐性下调的信号，而这种下调如果未同步更新披露版本，直接构成披露违规。</p>\n<h2 id=\"健康度指标\">健康度指标</h2><p>健康度指标是三角里最容易被忽略的一角，因为它不直接对应收入。</p>\n<h3 id=\"消费集中度\">消费集中度</h3><p>消费集中度衡量收入在用户间的分布。计算口径通常是头部用户消费占比。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def concentration(spend_by_user):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;返回 top 1% / top 5% / top 10% 用户的消费占比。&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    values = sorted(spend_by_user.values(), reverse=True)&#10;    total = sum(values)&#10;    if total == 0:&#10;        return {&quot;top1&quot;: 0.0, &quot;top5&quot;: 0.0, &quot;top10&quot;: 0.0}&#10;    n = len(values)&#10;    def share(k):&#10;        idx = max(1, int(round(n * k)))&#10;        return round(sum(values[:idx]) / total, 4)&#10;    return {&quot;top1&quot;: share(0.01), &quot;top5&quot;: share(0.05), &quot;top10&quot;: share(0.10)}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> concentration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(spend_by_user):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"返回 top 1% / top 5% / top 10% 用户的消费占比。\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    values </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sorted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(spend_by_user.values(), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reverse</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(values)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"top1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"top5\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"top10\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(values)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> share</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(k):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        idx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(values[:idx]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"top1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: share(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"top5\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: share(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"top10\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: share(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个指标本身没有绝对阈值，价值在于<strong>趋势</strong>。消费集中度持续上升意味着收入越来越依赖少数重度用户，这些用户的退出会带来不成比例的收入下滑，同时也意味着伤害风险集中在这批人身上。研究在 gacha 游戏玩家中测量问题赌博严重度时发现，<strong>消费水平是最清晰的预测因素</strong>（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.00057\">arXiv:2504.00057</a>），这为&quot;重度消费需要单独关注&quot;提供了实证依据。</p>\n<h3 id=\"投诉-退款与未成年人占比\">投诉、退款与未成年人占比</h3><p>三个指标都应当按周监控。投诉与退款率的上升往往先于消费集中度恶化出现，是更早的预警。未成年人占比的监控则直接对应合规风险，相关保护手段见 <a href=\"../probability-compliance/minor-protection-spend-cap\">未成年人保护与消费上限</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"保护性指标的副作用\">保护性指标的副作用</h3><p>值得单独指出：设置消费上限、关闭个性化营销、限制高频抽取，都会在短期内压低收入与复购指标。若把收入指标作为唯一的考核依据，这些保护措施就会在运营压力下被逐步削弱。正确的做法是把健康度指标与收入指标并列纳入同一套考核，使保护措施有独立的、不被收入指标覆盖的依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"指标体系与合规的衔接\">指标体系与合规的衔接</h2><p>运营指标不只是内部管理工具，其中若干项直接对应披露义务。</p>\n<h3 id=\"实际分布必须可被审计\">实际分布必须可被审计</h3><p>披露的是概率，验证的是实际分布。若运营系统无法按系列与配置版本产出实际出货分布，就无法证明自己兑现了公示。上文的 <code>drift</code> 查询应当作为例行产出，而不是争议发生时才临时跑一次。相关审计机制见 <a href=\"../probability-model-config/fair-randomness-audit\">随机抽取公平性与随机数审计</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"期望成本与兜底价格的披露\">期望成本与兜底价格的披露</h3><p>期望毛利计算中的期望成本，与消费者侧披露的兜底直购价直接相关。若系统算不出期望成本，就无法给出一个合理的兜底价格；若兜底价格低于期望成本，长期执行会亏损。这两处的口径必须统一，相关披露要求见 <a href=\"../probability-compliance/disclosure-odds-requirement\">概率明示与价值披露要求</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二级市场指标的引入\">二级市场指标的引入</h3><p>复购指标若忽略二级市场价格，会读错信号。当二级市场溢价高企时，复购上升可能并非喜爱而是套利动机，此时应当把二级市场指标纳入同一看板，具体信号见 <a href=\"resale-speculation-signal\">二级市场炒作信号</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>概率商品指标须收入、参与、健康三类同时看，只看前两类会用保底拉升制造短期繁荣。</li>\n<li>期望毛利事前可算，保底会系统抬高期望成本，须用模拟而非基础概率估算。</li>\n<li>实际出货分布与配置概率的漂移是收入指标的护栏，应例行产出而非事后临时计算。</li>\n<li>抽次分布的形态比复购率更有信息，集中在保底阈值附近说明复购由沉没成本驱动。</li>\n<li>消费集中度看趋势而非绝对值，重度消费是伤害风险集中的人群。</li>\n<li>保护性措施会压低短期收入指标，健康度指标必须与收入指标并列考核才能不被削弱。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"概率商品运营与复购指标","id":"概率商品运营与复购指标"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三类指标的三角","id":"核心概念-三类指标的三角"},{"level":2,"text":"收入与成本指标","id":"收入与成本指标"},{"level":3,"text":"期望毛利的计算口径","id":"期望毛利的计算口径"},{"level":3,"text":"保底成本的影响","id":"保底成本的影响"},{"level":2,"text":"参与指标：复购的正确读法","id":"参与指标-复购的正确读法"},{"level":3,"text":"抽次分布比复购率更有信息","id":"抽次分布比复购率更有信息"},{"level":3,"text":"保底触发率的运营含义","id":"保底触发率的运营含义"},{"level":2,"text":"健康度指标","id":"健康度指标"},{"level":3,"text":"消费集中度","id":"消费集中度"},{"level":3,"text":"投诉、退款与未成年人占比","id":"投诉-退款与未成年人占比"},{"level":3,"text":"保护性指标的副作用","id":"保护性指标的副作用"},{"level":2,"text":"指标体系与合规的衔接","id":"指标体系与合规的衔接"},{"level":3,"text":"实际分布必须可被审计","id":"实际分布必须可被审计"},{"level":3,"text":"期望成本与兜底价格的披露","id":"期望成本与兜底价格的披露"},{"level":3,"text":"二级市场指标的引入","id":"二级市场指标的引入"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"二级市场炒作信号","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/mystery-box-probability-commerce/secondary-market-guard/resale-speculation-signal"},"next":null}